        "safe_room": true,
        "danger": 1,
        "objective": "Step into the market lane and preview how barter, tuning, and habitat care can extend the rescue loop without softening its wasteland edge or its dark detailing.",
        "tutorial_tip": "This room is calm on purpose. After the combat proof, it widens the horizon with traders, ash cloth, brass fittings, dark awnings, and companion upkeep instead of more immediate violence.",
        "popup": {
