          "title": "Forward Market",
          "text": "Reliquary Bazaar is a promise room, but it still belongs to the same world. The expedition loop can widen into barter, roster tuning, shrine upkeep, and provisioning without losing its rescue-first, dust-scoured, soot-lined identity."
